# Virtual environments
.venv

# Derived caches (regenerated by the pipeline). cache/facts*.json is kept: it is the
# reviewable record of what was extracted from the documents. Every subdirectory is derived:
# text/, images/ and extraction/ for the published corpus, and one directory per further
# corpus, holding that corpus's own caches, facts and answer.
cache/*/
cache/*.txt

